+Keep final.md as the continuous encounter, with its single position line and the critical distinctions carried by the prose. The first tutorial is read separately. Only its source-reference footnote needs to follow this narrower making exercise. A correct program, an intelligible lesson and a compelling room require different evidence; native execution alone cannot settle the last two.
